 "remarks": "Turnkey Furnished Stamford Condo | Garage Parking + Wi-Fi Included  Move right in and feel at home from day one in this beautifully renovated, fully furnished 1-bedroom, 1.5-bath Stamford condo. Designed for effortless long-term living, this residence is ideal for corporate relocations/assignments, professionals new to the area, or anyone seeking a stylish, fully equipped home without the expense and hassle of furnishing one.  Completely renovated from top to bottom, the residence features brand-new LVP flooring throughout, a beautifully updated kitchen with stone countertops and stainless steel appliances, and newly renovated full and half baths. The bright, open-concept living area extends to a private balcony, while the spacious bedroom offers a walk-in closet and direct balcony access.  Also included are a dedicated desk/workspace, kitchenware, linens and everything needed to settle in. Wi-Fi included along with a brand-new full-size washer and dryer conveniently located inside the unit.  Dedicated parking in the garage provides added convenience, and residents also enjoy access to the building's fitness room.  Ideally located in Mid-City Stamford w/ convenient access to downtown, Metro-North, restaurants, retail, major employers and commuter routes throughout Fairfield County and the NY metro area.  Fully furnished * Wi-Fi included * In-unit laundry * Garage parking * Private balcony * Fitness room   12-month lease required. Tenant responsible for electrici",
